-- Source module: Solutions.J6SegAxBud5
/-!
# B-line axis budget 5: the chunk pass costs `≤ T · Y`

**`chunk_cost_nat`**: on an axis with `AxNum`,
`kerC Ck Bk (2^fC) post Lc nc |TC| pre NC ≤ T · cY` at the witnesses of `J6SegAxBud4`, with
`cY = 2·10^9 (BI + BH + 2) + 2 Yb + 10^4 + 2 + 5·10^6 (Bk + 2)`.
